285
00:17:01,324 --> 00:17:02,324
うん。
Yeah.

286
00:17:02,324 --> 00:17:18,024
でもね、正直ね、キョーコが最初から体力オバケだなとか、この人ちょっと我々が思っている人間とは格が... 人種が違う？ なんて言うんじゃろ？ もう最初から「最強」って感じちゃったから...
But honestly, from the very beginning, I felt like Kyoko was a stamina monster, or like... this person is on a whole different level from what we consider human... a different species? How should I put it? I felt like she was "the strongest" right from the start...

287
00:17:18,024 --> 00:17:19,624
