Yeah, of course! Do you remember when we first met face-to-face?

289
00:17:24,424 --> 00:17:25,524
覚えてるよ、もちろん！
I remember, of course!

290
00:17:25,524 --> 00:17:38,724
あん時さ、結構配信とかでも言ってるんじゃけどさ、一人だけ声のデカさも違うし、声だけじゃなくて身振り手振りもだし、なんじゃろな、最強が服を着て歩いてるような...
Back then... I've said this on stream quite a bit, but... your voice alone was on another level of volume, and not just your voice, but your gestures too... how do I put it? It was like "The Strongest" put on clothes and was walking around...

291
00:17:41,524 --> 00:17:51,924
そう、なんか最初から「わし人間いっぱい見てきたけど、およ？ なんじゃこの人間？ わしが思っている人間と違う？」って思った。
Yeah, right from the start I thought, "I've seen plenty of humans, but whoa? What is this human? Is this different from the humans I know?"

292
00:17:51,924 --> 00:17:53,024
マジで？！
Seriously?!

293
00:17:53,024 --> 00:18:00,624
