Yeah, I was like "Here we go, here we go, here we go," opening the door. "Alright," there were lots of staff members there too, so I thought "Alright, let's do this." We didn't even know what each other looked like or what our names were, we were put in the room knowing nothing! So I was looking over thinking "Who could it be?" and then you sprang right up...

